{"seq":2,"slug":"adverse-selection","title":"逆向选择与保险市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/adverse-selection","wordCount":1956,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"逆向选择与保险市场\">逆向选择与保险市场</h1><p>1970 年，George Akerlof 在《柠檬市场》论文中揭示了信息不对称如何摧毁一个原本可以正常运作的市场。六年后，Rothschild 和 Stiglitz 将这一逻辑精确地移植到保险市场，证明了在投保人掌握自身风险类型的私人信息时，保险市场可能根本无法达到帕累托有效的均衡。这篇文档剖析逆向选择在保险市场中的完整机制——从死亡螺旋到分离均衡，从理论模型到现实应对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>逆向选择是保险交易<strong>之前</strong>的信息不对称：投保人比保险公司更清楚自身风险类型，形成&quot;隐藏信息&quot;（hidden information）问题。当保险公司只能按人群平均风险定价时，低风险者发现保费高于其真实风险而退出，池内高风险比例上升、保费被迫再涨——这个自我强化的过程就是<strong>死亡螺旋</strong>。Rothschild-Stiglitz 模型进一步指出，竞争性市场中的稳定结果只能是<strong>分离均衡</strong>：高风险者获得完全保险、低风险者接受含免赔额的部分保险，而免赔额的功能是&quot;自我选择约束&quot;下的<strong>筛选装置</strong>。经验检验（正相关检验）的结果混合，提示&quot;有利选择&quot;可能部分抵消逆向选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐藏信息</td>\n<td>交易前投保人知悉自身风险</td>\n<td>平均定价引发逆向选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡螺旋</td>\n<td>低风险退出→保费上升→更多退出</td>\n<td>极端情形市场崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分离均衡</td>\n<td>两类人购买不同合同</td>\n<td>免赔额是筛选装置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有利选择</td>\n<td>低风险者同时更厌恶风险</td>\n<td>抵消部分逆向选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"逆向选择的核心机制\">逆向选择的核心机制</h2><p>逆向选择发生在保险交易之前（ex ante），本质是一个&quot;隐藏信息&quot;（hidden information）问题。投保人比保险公司更了解自身的风险水平——健康状况、驾驶习惯、物业安全措施等——而保险公司无法完美区分高风险与低风险个体。</p>\n<p>当保险公司被迫按人群平均风险水平定价时，一个破坏性的筛选过程启动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{avg} = p_H \\cdot \\alpha + p_L \\cdot (1-\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为高风险和低风险人群的期望损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为高风险人群比例。对低风险个体而言，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{avg} &gt; p_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，保费相对其真实风险过高；对高风险个体，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{avg} &lt; p_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，保费相对其真实风险是&quot;便宜&quot;的。</p>\n<p>结果：低风险个体退出市场 → 池中高风险比例上升 → 保费被迫提高 → 更多低风险退出 → 保费进一步上升……这就是&quot;死亡螺旋&quot;（death spiral）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[保险公司按平均风险定价] --&gt; B[低风险者觉得保费过高]&#10;    B --&gt; C[低风险者退出保险池]&#10;    C --&gt; D[池内平均风险上升]&#10;    D --&gt; E[保险公司提高保费]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt; F[极端情况: 市场崩溃]\">flowchart TD\n    A[保险公司按平均风险定价] --&gt; B[低风险者觉得保费过高]\n    B --&gt; C[低风险者退出保险池]\n    C --&gt; D[池内平均风险上升]\n    D --&gt; E[保险公司提高保费]\n    E --&gt; B\n    E --&gt; F[极端情况: 市场崩溃]</pre><h2 id=\"rothschild-stiglitz-模型\">Rothschild-Stiglitz 模型</h2><p>Rothschild 和 Stiglitz（1976）在竞争性保险市场中证明了一个令人不安的结论：在某些参数条件下，纯策略纳什均衡根本不存在。</p>\n<p><strong>模型设定</strong>：两类风险人群——高风险（概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 发生损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>）和低风险（概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 发生损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_H &gt; p_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。保险公司提供合同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha, \\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是事故状态下的赔付，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是保费。</p>\n<p><strong>关键结果</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>混同均衡不存在</strong>：如果所有人买同一份合同，任何公司都可以设计一份只对低风险者有吸引力的合同来盈利</li>\n<li><strong>分离均衡可能存在</strong>：高风险者获得完全保险（零免赔），低风险者获得部分保险（有免赔额）</li>\n<li><strong>均衡可能不存在</strong>：当低风险人群比例足够大时，分离均衡中低风险合同的利润可以被混同偏离打破</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>均衡类型</th>\n<th>高风险者合同</th>\n<th>低风险者合同</th>\n<th>存在条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分离均衡</td>\n<td>完全保险，高保费</td>\n<td>部分保险，低保费</td>\n<td>高风险比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 足够大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混同均衡</td>\n<td>统一合同</td>\n<td>统一合同</td>\n<td>永远不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无均衡</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 过小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分离均衡的核心设计原则是&quot;自我选择约束&quot;（self-selection constraint，也称激励相容约束）：低风险者的合同必须&quot;差&quot;到让高风险者不愿意伪装成低风险者来购买。这意味着免赔额不是为了节省赔付，而是作为一种筛选装置（screening device）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向选择的经验证据\">逆向选择的经验证据</h2><p>经验检验逆向选择的标准方法是&quot;正相关检验&quot;（positive correlation test）：控制保险公司的定价变量后，选择更高覆盖率的人群是否事后表现出更高的索赔率？</p>\n<p>实际证据出人意料地混合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>支持逆向选择</strong>：美国 Medigap 市场（Ettner 1997）、英国年金市场（Finkelstein &amp; Poterba 2004）发现了显著的正相关</li>\n<li><strong>不支持逆向选择</strong>：法国汽车保险（Chiappori &amp; Salanié 2000）、美国人寿保险（Cawley &amp; Philipson 1999）未发现正相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种矛盾的解释之一是&quot;有利选择&quot;（advantageous selection）：低风险个体可能恰好也更加风险厌恶，因此同时表现出&quot;低事故率&quot;和&quot;高投保意愿&quot;，抵消了传统逆向选择效应。更风险厌恶的人既更少冒险（低风险），又更愿意买保险——两个力量方向相反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应对逆向选择的制度设计\">应对逆向选择的制度设计</h2><p>保险市场和监管者发展出多种机制来缓解逆向选择：</p>\n<p><strong>市场层面的应对</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>风险分类定价</strong>（experience rating / risk classification）：利用可观测特征（年龄、性别、职业、信用评分等）将投保人分入更同质的风险组，缩小组内信息不对称</li>\n<li><strong>合同菜单设计</strong>（menu of contracts）：提供不同免赔额-保费组合，利用自我选择机制让不同风险类型的人&quot;自我暴露&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>等待期与既往症排除</strong>（waiting periods / pre-existing condition exclusions）：限制高风险者立即获益的能力</li>\n<li><strong>无赔款折扣</strong>（no-claims bonus）：利用事后经验来修正事前的信息不对称</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>监管层面的应对</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>强制保险</strong>（mandatory insurance）：消除退出选项，强制低风险者留在池中（如汽车责任险、医疗保险个人强制参保）</li>\n<li><strong>社区费率管制</strong>（community rating）：禁止基于某些特征的差异化定价（如 ACA 禁止健康状况定价）</li>\n<li><strong>风险调整转移支付</strong>（risk adjustment）：在保险公司之间转移资金以补偿承保更多高风险人群的公司</li>\n<li><strong>保证续保条款</strong>（guaranteed renewability）：防止保险公司在获知投保人风险上升后拒绝续保</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的逆向选择-aca-补贴到期的自然实验\">2026 年的逆向选择：ACA 补贴到期的自然实验</h2><p>2025 年底，美国平价医疗法案（ACA）增强版保费税收抵免到期。KFF 估计 2026 年受补贴投保者的平均净保费将上涨 114%——从年均 888 美元升至 1,904 美元。Urban Institute 预测将新增 480 万未保险人口。这正是一个教科书式的逆向选择展开过程：补贴减少 → 健康人群退出 → 保险池风险上升 → 保费上调 → 更多人退出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>逆向选择是保险交易前的&quot;隐藏信息&quot;问题</li>\n<li>当保费无法反映风险异质性时，死亡螺旋可能导致市场崩溃</li>\n<li>Rothschild-Stiglitz 模型揭示了竞争保险市场中分离均衡的逻辑和均衡存在性的脆弱性</li>\n<li>免赔额作为筛选装置的经济功能超越了简单的成本分担</li>\n<li>经验证据表明&quot;有利选择&quot;可能部分抵消传统逆向选择</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"moral-hazard\">道德风险</a>：保险交易后的另一类信息不对称问题</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../game-theory/information-and-games/signaling-and-screening\">信号与筛选</a>：逆向选择的应对机制在博弈论中的一般化分析</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逆向选择与保险市场","id":"逆向选择与保险市场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向选择的核心机制","id":"逆向选择的核心机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Rothschild-Stiglitz 模型","id":"rothschild-stiglitz-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向选择的经验证据","id":"逆向选择的经验证据"},{"level":2,"text":"应对逆向选择的制度设计","id":"应对逆向选择的制度设计"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的逆向选择：ACA 补贴到期的自然实验","id":"2026-年的逆向选择-aca-补贴到期的自然实验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"风险池化与保险需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/risk-pooling-and-insurance-demand"},"next":{"title":"道德风险与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/foundations/moral-hazard"}}